{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1664.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"eb8f2cf0103d7d486e7201a1e11ab640122acb6546b7da7d4dd776ceda2fde67","ja":"可奈ちゃん、どうしたんだい？","zh":"可奈，你怎么了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1664.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"035c61a13cd7105ee0a54ce55fa7cf32dac28ceeae05c941ba95742a13a540ba","ja":"絵のスタンドを落としそうになっちゃって……。\nでもキャッチできたから、大丈夫だよ！","zh":"画架差点掉地上了……\n不过我已经接住了，所以没关系哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1664.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"72411005f7a42a66d7ce590a8d7c9330dc8e3022cf295f1cb984a6d7d542f925","ja":"それは何よりでした。ただ、スタンドの裏から、\n紙のようなものが落ちたようでしたが？","zh":"那真是太好了。不过，看台背面\n好像掉下来了像是纸一样的东西？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1664.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8ce38d1009516f0f5ea706dafe049756b3b5d5819055a62e43f1f22d98ef8938","ja":"えっ……あ、これかな？　なんだろ……って、時間！\nふたりともごめんなさい！　急ぎましょ～！","zh":"诶……啊，是这个吗？是什么呢……等等，时间！\n两位对不起！我们快抓紧时间吧～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1664.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"069e3d91df12c4d417973ffaf1552289f1004be928e121c41c1c5290b5e5a78f","ja":"アンコールとお菓子は大好評。\n歓声を浴びながら、3人は控室へ戻ってきて……。","zh":"安可的点心大受欢迎。\n3人伴着欢呼声回到了休息室……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1664.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"1902225f501ade374795e28b71f3a58c466b486f3c46a44d61fe992518dacf93","ja":"えへへ、夜公演も楽しみだな～♪　あ、その前に、\nさっきのスタンドを、元の場所に置いて……。","zh":"嘿嘿，晚场公演也好期待啊～♪　啊，在那之前，\n得先把刚才的花架放回原处……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1664.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"e209753d3fd7f133e69ed83531a436be3507cb438d630b5f26c2cda3814c90f8","ja":"落ちてきた紙も、裏に戻して……って、あれ？\nな、なんだろこれ。お札みたいだけど……？","zh":"把掉下来的纸也放回背面……咦？\n这、这是什么啊。虽然看着像符咒……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1664.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"b75993192fb6cfe6133194aa2390b465902d68a7e0dd3e4bdb05a600384ef9ee","ja":"そのようですね……。\n『魔除け』、と書いてありますし……。","zh":"好像确实如此呢……。\n上面还写着“驱魔辟邪”……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1664.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"2e5b5947d2848eac67d44131268e1a2edd943e10cc551f73f23ad9a07afce04c","ja":"魔除けのお札が、\nどうしてこんなところにあるんだろか……？","zh":"驱邪用的符咒，\n怎么会放在这种地方呢……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1664.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"c10467ba3a11df1f16dbb4825655f6ff7aa00f0cb8f240d19bf666ab152a0398","ja":"わ、わからないけど……。\nと、とりあえず丁寧に、ちゃんと元の場所に……。","zh":"我、我也不太懂就是了……\n总、总之先小心翼翼地，好好放回原处吧……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
